- Number of destination stores: {NUM_DESTINATIONS}
- Warehouse supplies (units available): {SUPPLIES}
- Store demands (units required): {DEMANDS}
- Variable shipping cost per unit by lane ($/unit): {COST_MATRIX}
- Emission rate per unit by lane (kg CO2/unit): {EMISSION_MATRIX}
- Cost importance weight: {WEIGHT_COST}
- Emission importance weight: {WEIGHT_EMISSION}
- Route setup/activation costs (one-time per active lane): {FIXED_COSTS}
- Minimum order quantities per activated lane (units): {MIN_ORDER_QUANTITIES}
- Maximum suppliers per store: {MAX_SUPPLIERS_PER_STORE}
